### =========================================================================
### Car Sharing API - HTTP Requests (Task #2 Protected with Basic Auth)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Credentials: admin / admin123 (or user / user123)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = admin
@password = admin123

### =========================================================================
### 10 HTTP Requests (0.5 points for each request = 5.0 points)
### =========================================================================

### Request 1: Get all users
# Отримати список усіх користувачів (захищено Basic Auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 2: Get user by ID
# Отримати користувача за ідентифікатором
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 3: Create a new user
# Створити нового користувача
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "email": "marta.shevchenko@example.com",
  "fullName": "Marta Shevchenko",
  "driverLicense": "BX556677"
}

###

### Request 4: Update user by ID
# Оновити дані існуючого користувача
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "fullName": "John Doe Updated",
  "driverLicense": "DL12345-NEW"
}

###

### Request 5: Delete user by ID
# Видалити користувача за ідентифікатором
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/2
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

###

### Request 6: Get all vehicles
# Отримати список усіх транспортних засобів
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 7: Get vehicle by ID
# Отримати транспортний засіб за ідентифікатором
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 8: Create a new vehicle
# Додати новий транспортний засіб
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "brand": "Hyundai",
  "model": "Ioniq 5",
  "registrationNumber": "CE7788EE",
  "fleetId": "1",
  "rentedByUserId": null
}

###

### Request 9: Rent a vehicle to user
# Орендувати транспортний засіб для користувача
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles/1/rent?userId=1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 10: Get all fleets
# Отримати список усіх автопарків
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### =========================================================================
### Additional / Verification Requests
### =========================================================================

### Request 11: Get fleet by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets/1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Request 12: Create new fleet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/fleets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "2",
  "name": "North Station Fleet",
  "address": "Heroiv Maydanu St. 15",
  "capacity": 30
}

###

### Request 13: Test Unauthenticated Request (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
# Перевірка захисту: запит без заголовка авторизації повертає 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json
